  "title": "Sweet and Tangy Pulled Chicken Sandwiches",
  "description": "A can of soda, some condiments, and boneless chicken combine to make magic in the slow cooker, resulting in sweet and tangy pulled chicken for sandwiches your family will love.",
  "authors": [
    "MissPreNintendo"
  ],
